        "end": 22,
        "text": "The basic objects of linear algebra are vector spaces.\nThe vector space of most interest to us is $\\mathbf{C}^{n}$, the space of all $n$-tuples of complex numbers, $\\left(z_{1}, \\ldots, z_{n}\\right)$."
      }
