        "start": 329,
        "end": 335,
        "text": "Exercise 2.6: Show that any inner product $(\\cdot, \\cdot)$ is conjugate-linear in the first argument,\n\n$$\n\\begin{equation*}\n\\left(\\sum_{i} \\lambda_{i}\\left|w_{i}\\right\\rangle,|v\\rangle\\right)=\\sum_{i} \\lambda_{i}^{*}\\left(\\left|w_{i}\\right\\rangle,|v\\rangle\\right) .\n\\tag{2.15}\n\\end{equation*}\n$$"
      }
