        "text": "Exercise 2.35: (Exponential of the Pauli matrices) Let $\\vec{v}$ be any real, three-dimensional unit vector and $\\theta$ a real number.\nProve that\n\n$$\n\\begin{equation*}\n\\exp (i \\theta \\vec{v} \\cdot \\vec{\\sigma})=\\cos (\\theta) I+i \\sin (\\theta) \\vec{v} \\cdot \\vec{\\sigma} \\tag{2.58}\n\\end{equation*}\n$$\n\nwhere $\\vec{v} \\cdot \\vec{\\sigma} \\equiv \\sum_{i=1}^{3} v_{i} \\sigma_{i}$."
