        "text": "Another important matrix function is the trace of a matrix.\nThe trace of $A$ is defined to be the sum of its diagonal elements,\n\n$$\n\\begin{equation*}\n\\operatorname{tr}(A) \\equiv \\sum_{i} A_{i i} \\tag{2.59}\n\\end{equation*}\n$$"
